words="Kabhi Ganga Aarti | live dekhi hai? | Nahi dekhi toh | is baar Rishikesh | chalte hain. | Yakeen maano | woh feel phone mein | nahi aati | jo live dekhne | ka maza hai. | Humne launch kiya hai | Delhi se Haridwar Rishikesh | ek stranger trip, | woh bhi sirf | 5,500 mein. | Saath mein sirf | 16-36 saal ke log rahenge | aur ek trip captain | jo aapko har cheez | guide karta chalega | aur full masti | karata chalega, | aur poora trip | weekend par | rehne wala hai, | toh koi bhi office ka | jhanjhat nahi rahega. | Toh plan suno: | Raat ko 11 baje | Delhi se niklenge | aur subah seedha | Haridwar ke ghat pe, | jisko Ganga mein | dubki lagaani hai | woh laga lo, | phir jaayenge | Mansa Devi ke darshan | ke liye. | Wahan se seedha | hum jaane wale hain | Rishikesh hotel mein | check in, | thoda aaram, | uske baad seedha | shaam ko Ganga Aarti. | Bhai woh diye | aur woh mantra, | matlab rongte khade | ho jaate hain | logon ke. | Raat ko dinner | aur phir bas | dher saari gappe maarenge. | Agle din subah | Ganga kinare | yoga aur meditation, | phir aaram se | naashta karenge, | uske baad Ram Jhule pe | ghoomne bhi jaayenge, | cafe mein baithenge. | Rafting ka mann ho toh | woh bhi kar sakte hain. | Aur haan, | travel, hotel, khaana | aur yoga | sab package mein hi hai, | aur poore trip pe | ek trip captain | aapke saath rahega, | jo aapko ek doosre se | connect rakhega, | aur koi dikkat bhi | nahi hone dega. | Details chahiye toh | neeche Book_Now pe | click karo, | seedha WhatsApp mein | baat karte hain."
